<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: Waiting On Wilma
</h4>

<p>
Get yourself on one of those Air Force reconnaissance planes and do a first-person narrative on viewing Wilma from 30,000 feet. For all the destruction these hurricanes bring, they're supposed to be beautiful, almost calming sights from above.<br />
<br />
Yeah, it's probably been done before, along with 500 other ideas. But that's what happens when you have 10 of these bad boys every year. Just worry about writing a compelling story. 
</p>
